<title>CANADA: Air Canada to up domestic cargo rates 5pct.</title>
<headline>Air Canada to up domestic cargo rates 5pct.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Canada will increase domestic cargo rates by 5 percent effective March 1, an airline official said.</p>
<p>The increase follows a three percent rise on some international corridors on January 1. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
